[
  {
    "text": "七月十一日，诺斯科娃在温网登顶。但她的年终之路，还要从一月讲起。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "573afc9a18d284b5ad2f65a8d19a7417"
  },
  {
    "text": "布里斯班、澳网，都止步第三轮；澳网两盘负于王欣瑜。多哈、迪拜，都是第二轮。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "f022cafe9c9f979f8beea7ead4d922b4"
  },
  {
    "text": "三月，她在印第安维尔斯打进4强。半决赛，对面是世界第一萨巴伦卡。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "6a3440d33bc0220cf9a507d384ede9df"
  },
  {
    "text": "迈阿密首战失利，斯图加特打进8强。马德里，她抢七击败高芙，晋级8强。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "c597d28d11093c10d4e27e419b20a26c"
  },
  {
    "text": "随后，她负于科斯秋克，止步马德里8强，罗马止步第四轮。法网首轮，又以五比七、六比七负于萨卡里。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "a16088662dfd6a9cce19b5ac1fe08978"
  },
  {
    "text": "二十六天后，故事转向草地。伯林决赛，她三盘击败佩古拉，拿到本季首冠，也是生涯第二冠。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "371475a08053dba2c8c24f0d19c963e4"
  },
  {
    "text": "巴特洪堡首轮出局后，她来到温网。跨过凯斯、梅尔滕斯和科斯秋克，她首次打进大满贯决赛。最后一关，是朋友穆霍娃。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "6d90ce9a8f03e2f3ca7e18df904f931b"
  },
  {
    "text": "北美夏天，多伦多首战出局，辛辛那提止步第四轮。美网，她第一次打进8强。再次面对萨巴伦卡，胜负直到决胜盘抢十才揭晓。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "91e60f6d4b219d46eae305f612e54529"
  },
  {
    "text": "九月，她帮助捷克夺得比利简金杯。北京止步第四轮后，北京时间十月九日，官方确认她首次入围年终。十一日，她因左小腿受伤退出武汉。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "a590c08c0bddb8d7acb78a0435c52256"
  },
  {
    "text": "温网夺冠后的晚宴上，她把感谢留给母亲。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "f1b5ecf92e44204094f03a7e3910aef9"
  },
  {
    "text": "第一次年终，她会带来怎样的惊喜？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "9de3a35254570018d3ba02052421bfd0"
  },
  {
    "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
    "rate": "+6%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "style": "",
    "styledegree": "",
    "lead_pause": 0.0,
    "backend": "edge",
    "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83"
  }
]
